The mutation schema is different from what I assumed. The `id` goes as a top-level argument to `issueUpdate`, not inside the `input` object. Let me restructure the mutation:

```graphql
mutation {
  issueUpdate(id: "i-23", input: { assigneeId: "u-priya" }) {
    success
    issue {
      id
      title
      identifier
      assignee { id name }
    }
  }
}
```

